WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Log a Drive with Text Parker.
The driver texts: Start Drive.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Parker: Drive started. Please don’t text and drive.
Reply DONE when you park.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
Fifteen minutes later, the driver texts: DONE.

00:12.000 --> 00:17.000
Parker presents the drive time, car, supervisor, and notes.
Reply YES to log, or send corrections.

00:17.000 --> 00:20.465
The driver replies YES.
Parker: Drive logged! Well done!
